---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Delete your account — WaveCheck"
  description="How to permanently delete your WaveCheck account and what happens to your data."
  ogType="article"
  ogTitle="Delete your WaveCheck account"
  ogDescription="How to permanently delete your WaveCheck account and what happens to your data."
  theme="light"
  bodyClass="bg-white text-primary-900 min-h-screen flex flex-col"
>
  <main class="flex-1">
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-primary-50 to-white">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-12 pb-8 sm:pt-16 sm:pb-10">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-premium-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Account</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Delete your account</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-primary-600 leading-relaxed">You can permanently delete your WaveCheck account directly from the app. Once confirmed, deletion is immediate and cannot be undone.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-6 pb-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">In-app steps</h2>
      <ol class="space-y-4">
        <li class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-primary-100 bg-white">
          <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary-900 text-white font-semibold flex items-center justify-center text-sm">1</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold">Open WaveCheck and sign in.</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-primary-500 mt-1">If you can't sign in, see the email option below.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-primary-100 bg-white">
          <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary-900 text-white font-semibold flex items-center justify-center text-sm">2</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold">Go to your profile, then tap <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-primary-100 text-primary-800 text-sm font-medium">Settings</span>.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-primary-100 bg-white">
          <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary-900 text-white font-semibold flex items-center justify-center text-sm">3</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold">Scroll to the bottom and tap <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-red-50 text-red-700 text-sm font-medium">Delete Account</span>.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-primary-100 bg-white">
          <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary-900 text-white font-semibold flex items-center justify-center text-sm">4</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold">Confirm the deletion when prompted.</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-primary-500 mt-1">Your account, data, and content are removed immediately.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">What gets deleted</h2>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-primary-100 bg-primary-50 p-6">
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-primary-700 leading-relaxed">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-premium-600 mt-1">&bull;</span> Your profile (display name, username, bio, avatar)</li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-premium-600 mt-1">&bull;</span> Every post you've made, including photos, videos, and condition reports</li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-premium-600 mt-1">&bull;</span> Your likes and follows</li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-premium-600 mt-1">&bull;</span> Your XP balance and any unredeemed reward records</li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-premium-600 mt-1">&bull;</span> Reports you've filed and notifications you've received</li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-premium-600 mt-1">&bull;</span> Your authentication record</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-primary-500">We may retain limited records (such as anonymised abuse logs) where the law allows or requires it.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Premium subscriptions</h2>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-primary-100 p-6 bg-white">
        <p class="text-primary-600 leading-relaxed">Deleting your WaveCheck account does <strong>not</strong> automatically cancel an active subscription. You'll need to cancel it through the App Store or Google Play separately:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 text-primary-600">
          <li><strong>iPhone:</strong> Settings &rsaquo; tap your name &rsaquo; Subscriptions &rsaquo; WaveCheck &rsaquo; Cancel.</li>
          <li><strong>Android:</strong> Google Play app &rsaquo; profile &rsaquo; Payments &amp; subscriptions &rsaquo; Subscriptions &rsaquo; WaveCheck &rsaquo; Cancel.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-6 pb-10">
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-primary-900 text-white p-8 sm:p-10 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Can't sign in?</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-primary-300 leading-relaxed">If you've lost access to your account and can't delete it from the app, email us from the address on the account and we'll handle the deletion for you.</p>
        <a href="mailto:support@wavecheck.app?subject=Account%20deletion%20request" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-6 px-6 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-white text-primary-900 font-semibold hover:bg-primary-100 transition">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
          support@wavecheck.app
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
